        "profile": "refit-help-168x84-pending-flush-v1"
      },
      {
        "message_id": 1269,
        "English": "A jigger spanker improves fore-and-aft performance, increasing speed against the wind.",
        "lines": [
          "A jigger spanker improves",
          "fore-and-aft performance,",
          "increasing speed against",
          "the wind."
