          "food."
        ],
        "pointer": 37379860,
        "compiled_hex": "5468697320726f6f6d2073746f72657320776174657220616e640a666f6f642e00",
        "profile": "refit-help-168x84-pending-flush-v1"
      },
      {
        "message_id": 1278,
        "English": "Cargo holds carry trade goods. You can install up to five holds.",
        "lines": [
          "Cargo holds carry trade",
          "goods. You can install up",
          "to five holds."
        ],
        "pointer": 37379893,
        "compiled_hex": "436172676f20686f6c6473206361727279207472616465200a676f6f64732e20596f752063616e20696e7374616c6c207570200a746f206669766520686f6c64732e00",
        "profile": "refit-help-168x84-pending-flush-v1"
      },
      {
        "message_id": 1279,
        "English": "You can add a cargo hold here, but it slightly reduces speed.",
        "lines": [
          "You can add a cargo hold",
          "here, but it slightly",
          "reduces speed."
        ],
        "pointer": 37379960,
        "compiled_hex": "596f752063616e20616464206120636172676f20686f6c640a686572652c2062757420697420736c696768746c79200a726564756365732073706565642e00",
        "profile": "refit-help-168x84-pending-flush-v1"
      },
      {
        "message_id": 1280,
        "English": "You can add a ram or bow gun here. Medium and larger ships can also add a split sail.",
        "lines": [
          "You can add a ram or bow",
          "gun here. Medium and larger",
          "ships can also add a split",
          "sail."
